bpmn-js-properties-panel
https://github.com/bpmn-io/bpmn-js-properties-panel

The engine-neutral properties panel bundled into the `@miragon/bpmn-modeler/design`
subpath (`@miragon/bpmn-modeler-properties-panel`) is a fork of
bpmn-js-properties-panel v5.65.0. The renderer, the standard-BPMN (neutral)
property provider, and their supporting utilities were adapted from that project;
group ids, entry ids, and translation keys are preserved. Modifications include
optionalising the command stack so the panel mounts on a readonly viewer,
deriving a readonly flag from the absence of the `modeling` service, adding a
design/implement mode filter, and dropping the bundled element icons.

